==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|аво́сь}}
* {{audio|Ru-авось.ogg|Audio|lang=ru}}

===Adverb===
{{ru-adv|аво́сь}}

# {{context|colloquial|lang=ru}} [[perhaps]], [[maybe]] {{qualifier|low certainty}}
#: {{ux|ru|'''Аво́сь''' [[повезти|повезёт]].|We/I may yet succeed. (with low certainty)|inline=y}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|аво́сь|m-in}}

# blind trust in divine providence; blind faith in sheer luck; blind trust in sheer luck; counting on a miracle
#: Наде́ясь на '''аво́сь''', я реши́л вы́ехать на встре́чную по́лосу, чтобы объе́хать про́бку.
#:: Counting on a '''miracle''', I decided to slip into the oncoming lane to get around the traffic jam.
# faith in serendipity; may still; might yet; possibly
#: {{lang|ru|[[русский|ру́сский]] «аво́сь»}}&nbsp;— said about the [[alleged]] [[unconcern]] of Russians and their [[tendency]] to [[rely]] on [[luck]]

